<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Ride cut to hold from buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Ride cut to hold from buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth analyst Mark Leslie said he cut his rating on Ride Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the snowboard manufacturer were up 1/2 to 13-1/8 Monday.</p>
<p>--&quot;While we applaud new management's initiatives to stay on the forefront of the industry, we believe the results of these actions will not be fully realized until 1997 and beyond,&quot; Leslie said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
